on_name", "content": "Sally in China"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "A Beijing Tour"}, {"type": "position", "content": 2}, {"type": "origin", "content": "scholar > Exploring Ancient Sites > The Great Wall"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 16}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about places in a limited range of social situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "detail "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a piece of information about something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I want a few more details about the tour. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le16ob02aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about things to do on a trip."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "rickshaw"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a small vehicle used in South East Asia for carrying one or two passengers"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We offer a rickshaw tour. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le16ob02aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "alley"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a narrow street between buildings"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You can explore the old alley."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le16ob02aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "heaven"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the place where God is believed to live"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You can visit the Temple of Heaven."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le16ob02aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "followed by"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "after"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You visit the square followed by the gardens."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le16ob02aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Beijing "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the capital city of China"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I want to go on a tour of Beijing. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le16ob02aud02"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le16ob02re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Offers, Suggestions and Requests"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you make an <span class=\"strong\">offer</span>, you ask someone if they want your help to do something. <br/>  Example: <span class=\"italic\">Can I carry that for you</span>? <br/><br/>   When you make a <span class=\"strong\">suggestion</span>, you give ideas or ways to do something. <br/>  Example: <span class=\"italic\">We could go to the supermarket first</span>. <br/><br/>   When you make a <span class=\"strong\">request</span>, you ask someone for help or to do something. <br/>  Example: <span class=\"italic\">Could you help me?</span>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Ask/Make\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Respond\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Offer\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">How may I help you?</span><br/><span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Can you tell me about the sites?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I would like \u2026 </span><br/> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Certainly.</span><br/><span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Of course.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Suggest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\">What do you suggest?</span><br/><span class=\\\"italic\\\"> You can take a tour.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Great, thanks.</span><br> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Thank you for the suggestion.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Request\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Would you like to know about the tours we offer?</span><br/> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Can I get your contact information?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Yes, please.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Imagine you are talking to a tourist on the street."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a dialogue between you and the tourist on the street (5-7 lines)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The tourist asks for suggestions about what to do."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make suggestions. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice your dialogue aloud with a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I ask for, make and respond to suggestions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about things to do on a trip."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I tell a partner my suggestions."}]}], "type": "sena"}